      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Dengzhanxixin injection is extracted from herbs of Erigeron breviscapusis. Its function includes activate blood, dispel stasis, unblock the collaterals and relieve pain. In clinical, it is widely used for static blood obstruction, wind-stroke and hemiplegia, numbness of limbs, deviated eyes and mouth, dysphasia, chest impediment, heart pain, ischemic stroke, coronary heart disease, and angina pectoris with the pattern mentioned above. In this paper, we planed to review the pharmacological and toxicological effects of Dengzhanxixin injection from relevant studies."},
